{"id": "1551365035882979394", "channel_id": "1551354997482983424", "author_id": "148499227650162689", "author_name": "serene.dream", "content": "I'd try: Hameln+Lotan+Ramona+[Caecus] to start off with.  \n\nSwap Caecus for Thais or Horla if you want to try those variants and different realm combos.   Caecus will help a bit because when you rouse him, every card you play will heal you. He also gives you access to Aqueor tentacles, so you can choose to shield each turn, which will also improve surviving. \n\nLotan will be focused on doing damage with a lot of strikes.    Rouse Caecus then Lotan then whoever.", "timestamp": "2026-09-20T22:50:47.523000+00:00", "thread_id": "1551354997482983424", "edited_timestamp": "2026-09-20T23:07:27.883000+00:00", "thread_title": "Give me suggestions on team build", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747333490184292", "1400747088995811358"]}
